            "review_text": "OK, to be honest, I stopped by the Baba stand at the Morro Bay farmers market, not because of the hummus. It was because of the wonderful red-headed gal that was working your booth. She turned out to be charming, helpful and informative. I had never tried hummus before. She explained it to me and helped me choose just the right one. I ended up buying 2 the first week and many more since then. Last week she talked me into trying the bread and I'm glad she did. I love her and I love your product.\nEmployees like her are hard to find. (I'm really bad with names or I would add it)"
