            "review_date": "2018-08-31 07:15:44",
            "review_text": "This has to be the best hummus I've ever had and the chips are an added bonus!! They have so many hummus flavors to choose from. Seriously this stuff is compared to drugs. Once you have a taste it, you can't stop. Haha. For the past few years they would make their way up to Fresno's River Park Farmers Market. But sad to say, they didn't come up this year. I'm sure everyone who bought their hummus here in town was saddened when  Baba's hummus didn't make an appearance. I know my family and I were sad. \n\nI hope I find their hummus when I go to SLO next weekend. If the owner is reading this, please come back to Fresno and sell your amazing hummus!"
