            "review_text": "Food was pretty good, although pretty pricy. I want a restaurant to succeed here, but where is the branding? The name Sublime comes with no info as to what kind of food is served. There is no identity established and no web presence. Even if the sign said, in big letters, \"Sublime: Healthy California Cuisine\" it would help a lot. To the owner: this is very basic business 101. You can't open a restaurant in 2015 without a website and a name that hints to the consumer what type of food you are serving!"
